id":2587152008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aNM6I","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T13:47:52Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T13:47:52Z","body":"This one change the sign of `EditorNode::get_object_icon` as well as some change I don't come up with. It probably won't resolve RemoteTree performance issue though, because we are still doing `ResourceLoader::exists()` for every icon, so mine is still relevant. I think I can rebase on top of this once it is settled.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2587152008/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591852321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2591852321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2591852321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6afIch","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T07:46:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T07:46:48Z","body":"Just asking, since we reaches beta and this one has a milestone 4.x, is it planned to catch up with 4.4? If not, I think mine can go ahead to privide a quick fix for #78645 and #98666.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591852321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607109614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2607109614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2607109614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bZVXu","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T12:23:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T13:19:30Z","body":"Unfortunately this breaks custom icons for scripts that aren't global classes. `@icon` is supposed to work in any script, even built-in ones. It affects Scene dock.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nCustom type icons (added via `add_custom_type()`) also broke. Although custom types were pretty much replaced by `class_name` by now, so it's less relevant. We still need to deprecate them properly though.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607109614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616157398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2616157398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2616157398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b72TW","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T16:01:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T16:01:10Z","body":"@KoBeWi, thanks for your detailed review. I'm glad you caught some issues and now I have a chance to fix them. I'll include fixes in my next push, including counterparts for the 4.3 version of the PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616157398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2618619558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2618619558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2618619558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cFPam","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T10:38:46Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T10:38:46Z","body":"OK. Pushed after addressing @KoBeWi's comments. I've kept most of the key function so the former algorithm can kick in unless the new fast path is able to fully leverage the class names cache.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2618619558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631546282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2631546282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2631546282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c2jWq","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T16:52:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T21:51:55Z","body":"I think the performance improvement is really significant and worth getting in 4.4 if we can, as the current slowness can rightfully be considered a bug.\r\n\r\nMy only concern is this:\r\n\r\n> UPDATE: I forgot to add that another potential regression is that the create node dialog won't be able to show the global classes before they have been parsed and cached, which is especially true in the cold case. If that's true and a concern, we could still fall back to parsing the script files or let the create dialog wait until the global classes cache is ready.\r\n\r\nDoes this mean that the first time you search for those classes, they don't show up at all, or do they show up with a slowdown? Not showing up at all would be a problem and might make people think that it's an engine bug. I remember we had such issues in the past where a newly created global class wouldn't resolve properly and that was causing a lot of confusion.\r\n\r\nI don't have a project locally to test easily, if anyone has open source games with tons of global classes, or a test project done for validating these changes, that would be useful. *Edit:* Calinou actually linked a test project above.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631546282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633818069","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2633818069","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2633818069,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c_N_V","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T12:51:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T12:51:44Z","body":"After rechecking the code with a fresher mind, I don't really think my concern was justified. What I'm changing in this PR is, in short, how the icon to a certain class name is obtained, once the class name is already known. In other words, if it's possible that you can get an incomplete type set in the create node dialog because the file system hasn't ended parsing the classes yet, that's without this PR as well.\r\n\r\nHowever, given the first file system scan, which includes populating the inventory or global classes, happens synchronously on the main thread, and very early, so, unless I'm missing something, the user has no chance of interacting with the editor early enough for the issue to exist.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633818069/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633865176","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2633865176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2633865176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c_ZfY","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T13:12:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T13:12:24Z","body":"Tested the PR with Calinou's project and a dev build. It's extremely slow in `master`, and just pretty slow (5s) in this PR, but that's with an unoptimized build and 10000 classes, so that's expected. Calinou's test results show what an optimized production build yields.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633865176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634263542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489#issuecomment-2634263542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101489","id":2634263542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dA6v2","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T15:09:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T15:09:24Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634263542/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]